flowchart TB
    subgraph Loop_Anatomy
        INIT([Initialize s₀]) --> POLICY[Policy π]
        POLICY --> ACT[Action a_t]
        ACT --> OBS[Observation o_t]
        OBS --> EVAL[Evaluator E]
        EVAL --> TRANS[Transition T]
        TRANS --> MEM[Memory M]
        MEM --> TERM{Termination τ?}
        TERM -->|continue| POLICY
        TERM -->|stop| OUT([Output s_final])
    end
    ENV[(Environment)] <--> ACT
